# Project Instructions & Rules

- **Git Task Workflow**: Whenever the user requests a new feature or task, always create a corresponding GitHub Issue (and add it to the project board if applicable) first using `gh issue create`. Include the task in the project's local `task.md` (the local todo/checklist file). Work on the task step-by-step, update the status in the todo/checklist file, and commit/push changes linking back to the GitHub issue.
